  "details": "Hello Vrc dev's\n\nI wanted to request a Quest upload limit upgrade from 40mb to at least 45mb I know a bunch of other avatar creators would also appreciate this upgrade too \n\nReasons - Some models we as avatar creators make could be high on poly and or texture count and sometimes it's easy to optimize if it's either or. But I've notice recently all the popular games are starting to not worrying about texture quality while making their games with RGB and making the poly count really high and while that may sound good it's really hard to keep them looking good and optimize enough for quest I've managed to get some under 40mb but I like making custom stuff with the files I'm given from games and while I have made a few only 2 of them have been available for quest and that when I wasn't really making big changes just small ones the ones I've made big changes too I've managed to get them either 42mb to 43mb so I'm asking for the future of model creation if you the Vrchat devs can update the upload limit for quest to at least 45mb",
